      "en": {
        "documentsRequired_md": "> **Documents required to apply under the scheme;**\n\n\n1. Aadhaar card\n1. Proof of age\n1. Caste certificate, if applicable\n1. Declaration for Assignment\n1. Declaration Form\n1. Certificate issued by competent authority stating that the applicant is currently engaged in skilled labour as a Coconut Tree Climber/Neera Technician/Harvester\n1. Payment details\n1. Any other document, as required\n\n> **In case of Accident:**\n\n\n1. Original Discharge summary/ OP Ticket\n1. Original Medical Bills ( duly certified by a doctor)\n1. Original Lab reports(if any)\n1. Immobilizations Certificate (Minimum 5 days continuous disablement is required)\n1. Fitness Certificate\n1. Disability Certificate (In case of disablement due to accident)\n1. FIR/GD Entry/CSR/Police Report (In case of road accident)\n1. NEFT details (Bank name, Branch, Account Number and IFSC)\n1. Duly signed claim voucher \n\n> **In case of Death:**\n\n\n1. Original Medical Reports\n1. Original Death Certificate\n1. Legal Heirship certificate\n1. Post Mortem Report\n1. FIR\n1. Newspaper cutting\n1. Viscera Report (if any)\n1. Inquest Report\n1. NEFT details (Bank name, Branch, Account Number and IFSC)\n1. Duly signed claim voucher \n\n",
